        "created_at": "2016-01-20T03:43:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay, so I tried the advanced version, and lost. Then I tried the regular version, beat it on the first try, and got near-mint. That doesn't seem intentional. I was under the impression that they were two separate achievements. Otherwise I would have gone for the easier first.</p>",
