        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-22T15:13:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was surprisingly difficult, since I honestly tend to see Voss as easy. Part of it was my fault -- miscalculated the whole Take Down/Meteor Shower thing, and thanks to the Maintenance Room, I didn't get things like Motivational Charge or Inspiring Presence because of the reshuffle.</p><p>Ended up with Tempest incapped, Legacy at 6 HP, Visionary at 5 HP and the Oxygen Leak doing most of the work (although Visionary finished him off with Demoralization).</p>",
