        "created_at": "2016-01-30T00:59:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I go away for a couple of weeks and find some controversy over this one-shot.&nbsp; I had a fairly easy time with it.&nbsp; I play against Voss a fair amount and I also play with three heroes most of the time.&nbsp; I'm not sure I've played this particular combo, but I've played very similar ones.&nbsp; This one was Normal difficulty on my Kindle Fire.</p>",
